            "text": "------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"message\"\r\n\r\nCreate 2026-09-26 - MicroCenter Unable to Recover Data from  MicroSD Card with Verizon Law Suit Working Files\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"placeholder_message\"\r\n\r\nCreate 2026-09-26 - MicroCenter Unable to Recover Data from  MicroSD Card with Verizon Law Suit Working Files\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"description\"\r\n\r\n\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"commit-choice\"\r\n\r\ndirect\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"target_branch\"\r\n\r\nmain\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"quick_pull\"\r\n\r\n\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"guidance_task\"\r\n\r\n\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"commit\"\r\n\r\nfee80eba6b0137cb8187500bb767d2931ff42ecd\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"same_repo\"\r\n\r\n1\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"pr\"\r\n\r\n\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"content_changed\"\r\n\r\ntrue\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"filename\"\r\n\r\n2026-09-26 - MicroCenter Unable to Recover Data from  MicroSD Card with Verizon Law Suit Working Files\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"new_filename\"\r\n\r\n2026-09-26 - MicroCenter Unable to Recover Data from  MicroSD Card with Verizon Law Suit Working Files\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0\r\nContent-Disposition: form-data; name=\"value\"\r\n\r\nDrove to MicroCenter in Cupertino to pick up microSD Card. Their techs were unable to mount the drive; their machines did not recognized the card. I was expecting I would have to pay $200 in any event, but I was nicely suprirsed there was no charge.\r\n------WebKitFormBoundary3PUTtoaB3SIbnjA0--\r\n",
